0 g BT /F3 8.5 Tf 72 164 Td (Schematic redrawing after John Snow's map in On the Mode of Communication of Cholera \(2nd ed., 1855\), which is) Tj ET
0 g BT /F3 8.5 Tf 72 151.68 Td (in the public domain. Streets simplified and not to scale; the bars show the pattern, not Snow's exact counts.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72 133.35 Td (Read it as Snow did: the bars pile up around one pump and thin out with distance from it,) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72 118.13 Td (even where other pumps are closer. The deaths follow the water, not the air.) Tj ET
0.45 g BT /F1 8.5 Tf 72 40 Td (The Broad Street Pump \(London, 1854\)  -  page 2 of 3) Tj ET
