stream
0 g BT /F2 17 Tf 72 716 Td (The exceptions that proved it) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 688.8 Td (Snow's strongest evidence came from the places that did not fit the simple picture. A) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 672.85 Td (workhouse on Poland Street, close to the pump, had several hundred residents but very) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 656.9 Td (few deaths: it had its own well. The men of a brewery on Broad Street drank the beer) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 640.95 Td (they were given and did not fetch water from the pump; none of them is known to have) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 625 Td (died.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 601.05 Td (The other way round, a widow living in Hampstead, miles away, died of cholera. She) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 585.1 Td (had liked the taste of the Broad Street water and had it carried to her. A niece who) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 569.15 Td (visited her and drank it died too.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F2 17 Tf 72 541.2 Td (The handle) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 514 Td (On 7 September 1854 Snow put his findings to the parish's Board of Guardians, and the) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 498.05 Td (next day the handle of the pump was taken off. The outbreak was already waning by) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 482.1 Td (then, as many people had fled, so the handle alone did not end it. But the map made) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 466.15 Td (the case in one look.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 442.2 Td (Later investigation found a likely source: a cesspool a few feet from the well, into) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 426.25 Td (which the washing of a sick baby at 40 Broad Street had been emptied just before the) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 410.3 Td (outbreak.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F2 17 Tf 72 382.35 Td (Why it still matters) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 355.15 Td (The Broad Street map is often called the founding picture of epidemiology: count the) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 339.2 Td (cases, put them where they happened, and let the pattern point at the cause. It also) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 11 Tf 72 323.25 Td (shows how a single clear figure can carry an argument that pages of tables could not.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F3 11 Tf 72 299.3 Td (Try this: open the chat and ask, 'What is this map telling me?') Tj ET
0.45 g BT /F1 8.5 Tf 72 40 Td (The Broad Street Pump \(London, 1854\)  -  page 3 of 3) Tj ET
